WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.922
Hello, little coder! Today you will tell a cat where to go — with arrows!

2
00:00:08.522 --> 00:00:11.930
Each arrow block moves the cat.

3
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:14.904
The right arrow moves right.

4
00:00:14.904 --> 00:00:17.878
The up arrow moves up.

5
00:00:18.478 --> 00:00:21.887
One arrow block moves one square.

6
00:00:21.887 --> 00:00:24.861
Two blocks move two squares.

7
00:00:25.461 --> 00:00:30.174
Put blocks in a row to make a script.

8
00:00:30.174 --> 00:00:34.887
The cat does them in order, one after another.

9
00:00:35.487 --> 00:00:40.200
Press Run to watch the cat follow your blocks.

10
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.643
Help the cat get to the star.

11
00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:49.357
Three right arrows — the cat got the star!

12
00:00:49.957 --> 00:00:53.800
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

13
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:58.948
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
